Root-only A3-L3 short registration capsule.

Run `python3 .cinder/act3-l3-difficulty-integration-20261016/root-verification/run.py seal`, then `python3 .cinder/act3-l3-difficulty-integration-20261016/root-verification/run.py native --seal ABSOLUTE_SUCCESSFUL_SEAL_JSON`. One canonical dev.godot_lock/dev.run_validation headless child executes existing tests/act3_l3_registration_smoke.gd with --entry-retry-only; finite180seconds after lock, native120second watchdog. No import/parser/alias mutation or broad suite.

Actual report ENV CINDER_A3_L3_REGISTRATION_REPORT targets a fresh unique owned native-report.json. Strict actual JSON sequential rows/check counters/firstfailure/complete/success/kind/source26/footer/pathSHA joins; no check count invented. Native-control-joins.json is retained before diagnostics review, so actual successful controls with CA-only diagnostics remain host NONCLEAN/refused, never relabeled clean. Raw/engine logs, original partial report, events/opaque receipt strings, canonical API result, lock lifecycle and beforequeue/atlock/afterchild/close source CAS retained. Canonical return is its API status, not independent OS process-terminal attestation. Root reviews diagnostics and scope.
